  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "`YamlParsed.NumberText`: the original source text of every `Number` and `Float` node (`1.10`, `1.0`, `1e3`, `0x1F`), keyed by JSON Pointer, from `ParseWithMetadata`, `TryParseWithMetadata` and `ParseMultipleWithMetadata`.\nAdding the `NumberText` field to the `YamlParsed` record is source-breaking for code that constructs a `YamlParsed` literal, so the next release is 0.2.0.\nRetargeted `net8.0` to `net10.0`: the library now targets `netstandard2.0` and `net10.0`, and the tests and Fable project target `net10.0`. `IsAotCompatible` is now set only for the `net10.0` target.",
